> > bib2html.conf as one of catlist_authors.
> > 
> 
> Can you give me a more precise example? If you mean this:
> Author = {Smith, J.}
> then I don't think I'm going to fix it. Your bibentry is not formatted
> correctly AFAIC.
> 
That's what I meant. Of course it's up to you if you want to fix it or 
not, but it is in fact allowed according to the BibTeX syntax. See p. 
399, sec. 13.5.2 of your LaTeX Companion.

