papers is getting rather long, so I was thinking that it would be nice 
if you could create a page per category/author/year etc. So at the top 
of each page I can select the sort order (for instance "sorted by 
year"), and then from the second list I select a given year, which will 
then take me to a page which lists all the papers from that year. What 
do you think?
-- 
Mark

