(Mark Moll)
Also, it would be nice if bib2html's special bibtex field names were 
configurable. For instance, I'd like to say something like this in my 
bib2html.conf:

bib2html_dl_html_name = url

because hubmed.org generates bibtex entries with that field. I think 
it's actually not too uncommon for people to use a url field, so it 
would be nice if you wouldn't have to fix your bibtex file for 
bib2html.
