DONE
(Mark Moll)
Saxon is not too happy with url's in this form:

  bib2html_dl_html = 
"http://www.hubmed.org/display.cgi?issn=&uids=15264253",

The "=" is causing an error. I guess some characters in url's need to 
be escaped.

